{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.FourTermRelation","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Quotient.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.descend_mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.descend_mk","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L109-L116","doc":"Descending a functional and then evaluating on a class recovers the\nfunctional (the descent is a genuine factorization through the quotient). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.descend","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.descend","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L102-L107","doc":"Any functional on the free module that vanishes on the relations descends\nto a weight system. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.pullback_vanishes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.pullback_vanishes","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L91-L100","doc":"The pullback of a weight system vanishes on the relations submodule. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.pullback","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.pullback","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L87-L89","doc":"The pullback of a weight system to a functional on the free module. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.apply_fourTerm_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.apply_fourTerm_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L67-L78","doc":"The four-term relation: a weight system annihilates every four-term\nrelator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.apply_isolated_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem.apply_isolated_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L55-L65","doc":"Framing independence: a weight system vanishes on any diagram carrying an\nisolated (adjacent-endpoint) chord. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.WeightSystem","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L49-L51","doc":"A **weight system** of degree `n`: an `R`-linear functional on the reduced\nchord-diagram space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.AReduced.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.AReduced.mk","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L45-L47","doc":"The class of a chord diagram in the reduced space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.AReduced.proj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.AReduced.proj","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L40-L43","doc":"The canonical projection from the free chord-diagram module onto the\nreduced space `𝒜`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.AReduced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KnotTheory.Vassiliev.AReduced","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KnotTheory/Vassiliev/WeightSystem.lean#L35-L38","doc":"The reduced chord-diagram space of degree `n`: the free module on chord\ndiagrams modulo the one- and four-term relations. ","signatureChunk":0}]}